{"version":1,"content":"<p>隨着美國政府持續加強對先進人工智能技術流向中國的監管，英偉達近期已向部分客户發出警告，提醒他們關注與中國企業獲取AI算力相關的潛在法律風險。知情人士透露，英偉達認為，一旦美國新的監管法律落地，無論是晶片供應商還是提供算力服務的數據中心運營商，都可能面臨監管調查甚至法律責任。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586794.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T12:33:58.279757+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T12:11:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T12:27:13.176094+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T12:27:13.176094+00:00","content_hash":"31ed39552e894ccfd907702faf15a8a5beee9ed1937bfa85faa3db4aea5c9c2d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}